No proprietary or vendor artwork is bundled. Native platform emoji rendering uses Unicode characters supplied by the operating system or browser; pixel-identical rendering with any platform or app is not promised. Asset URLs, where present in generated data, are HTTPS references only and are exposed to callers only when `allowRemoteAssets` is explicitly enabled.
